{{#> layout
  title='The fastest way to language mastery'
  metaDescription='Make ChatGPT, Gemini, or Claude reply in the language you are learning and correct your grammar. Copy the ready-made prompt and set it up in two minutes.'
  url='/ai.html'
  ogDescription='Use the language you are learning to solve your own problems. A ready-made AI prompt to get you started.'
  navbarAlwaysMurky=true
  navbarSpacing="mb-0"
  navbarContainerClass="container-md"
  noCta=true
  nonStickyNavbar=true
  disabledAutoTrack=true
}}
  <style>
    :root {
      --info-radius: 0.75rem;
      --info-padding: 1.25rem;
    }

    .select-language {
      border-radius: var(--info-radius);
      border: none;
      box-shadow: none;
      padding: var(--info-padding);
      background-position: right var(--info-padding) center;
    }

    .info-panel {
      padding: var(--info-padding);
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: var(--info-radius);
    }

    .info-panel[hidden] {
      display: none;
    }

    .call-out {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-style: italic;
      font-weight: 300;
      padding: 0.5rem 2rem;
      border-left: 4px solid #0050ff;
      max-width: 600px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 2rem 0;
    }

    #ai-tabs {
      .ai-tabs-nav {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.25rem;
        padding: 0.25rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        background: #ececec;
        border-radius: var(--info-radius);
      }

      .ai-tab {
        flex: 1 1 0;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0.4rem;
        padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
        border: 0;
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--bs-secondary-color);
        border-radius: calc(var(--info-radius) - 0.25rem);
        font-weight: 500;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
      }

      .ai-tab:hover {
        color: var(--bs-body-color);
      }

      .ai-tab[aria-selected='true'] {
        background: #fff;
        color: var(--bs-body-color);
        box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
      }

      .ai-tab .bi {
        font-size: 1.15em;
        line-height: 1;
      }

      .ai-instruction {
        margin: 0;
      }

      .bi-box-arrow-up-right {
        font-size: 0.85em;
        margin-left: 0.35em;
      }
    }
  </style>
  <div class="container-md">
    <div class="pt-3 pb-5">
      <h1 class="h3">How to use AI to advance in your language learning.</h1>

      <p style="font-size: 80%; font-style: italic;">This page is based on a discovery I made and shared with the <a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/learndutch/s/vlO10JmnUl" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">r/learndutch community on Reddit<i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right ms-2"></i></a>.</p>

      <p>You probably already thought of starting using AI for your language learning. Here is the trick how to make it not only respond in your Target Language but also correct your grammar and suggest the improvements on your styling.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="background: #f9f9f9;">
    <div class="container-md py-5" style="font-size: 80%">
      <h2 class="h5" style="color: var(--bs-body-color); font-size: 140%">The instruction</h2>

      <p>Three steps to make your AI provider (ChatGPT, Gemini, or Claude) reply in the language you're learning and correct your grammar along the way.</p>

      <div class="mb-5">
        <p>What language are you learning?</p>

        <select id="language" name='language' aria-label='Language' class="select-language form-select form-select-sm mb-4">
          {{#each htmlWebpackPlugin.options.environment.languages}}
            <option value='{{this.code}}'>{{this.label}}</option>
          {{/each}}
        </select>

        <p>Copy the following prompt:</p>

        <style>
          #prompt-wrapper {
            font-size: 90%;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            position: relative;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;

            #prompt {
              display: block;
            }

            #copy-button {
              position: absolute;
              bottom: var(--info-padding);
              right: var(--info-padding);
              display: flex;
              align-items: center;
              gap: 0.5rem;
              border-radius: 0.5rem;
              letter-spacing: -0.02em;
              font-size: 90%;
            }
          }
        </style>

        <pre class="info-panel" id="prompt-wrapper"><code id="prompt"></code><button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" id="copy-button"><i class="bi bi-copy"></i><span>Copy</span></button></pre>

        <p>Add it to the context of the AI you are using:</p>

        <div id="ai-tabs" class="mb-4">
          <div class="ai-tabs-nav" role="tablist" aria-label="AI assistant">
            <button
              type="button"
              role="tab"
              class="ai-tab"
              id="ai-tab-chatgpt"
              data-ai-tab="chatgpt"
              aria-controls="ai-panel-chatgpt"
              aria-selected="true"
            ><i class="bi bi-chat-dots"></i>ChatGPT</button>
            <button
              type="button"
              role="tab"
              class="ai-tab"
              id="ai-tab-gemini"
              data-ai-tab="gemini"
              aria-controls="ai-panel-gemini"
              aria-selected="false"
              tabindex="-1"
            ><i class="bi bi-stars"></i>Gemini</button>
            <button
              type="button"
              role="tab"
              class="ai-tab"
              id="ai-tab-claude"
              data-ai-tab="claude"
              aria-controls="ai-panel-claude"
              aria-selected="false"
              tabindex="-1"
            ><i class="bi bi-asterisk"></i>Claude</button>
          </div>

          <div
            class="info-panel"
            role="tabpanel"
            id="ai-panel-chatgpt"
            data-ai-panel="chatgpt"
            aria-labelledby="ai-tab-chatgpt"
          >
            <p class="ai-instruction">Paste the prompt into the <strong>Custom instructions</strong> section of <a
                href="https://chatgpt.com/#settings/Personalization"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener"
                class="link-secondary"
              >Personalization<i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a>.</p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="info-panel"
            role="tabpanel"
            id="ai-panel-gemini"
            data-ai-panel="gemini"
            aria-labelledby="ai-tab-gemini"
            hidden
          >
            <p class="ai-instruction">Open <a
                href="https://gemini.google.com/saved-info"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener"
                class="link-secondary"
              >Personal context<i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a>, tick the <strong>Your instructions for
                Gemini</strong> checkbox, then click <strong>+ Add</strong> and paste the prompt.</p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="info-panel"
            role="tabpanel"
            id="ai-panel-claude"
            data-ai-panel="claude"
            aria-labelledby="ai-tab-claude"
            hidden
          >
            <p class="ai-instruction">Paste the prompt into the <strong>Instructions for Claude</strong> section of your <a
                href="https://claude.ai/settings/profile"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener"
                class="link-secondary"
              >Claude Profile<i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p>Now the hard part: start solving your daily problems in <span data-language-string>your target language</span>. At first you'll look up a lot of words just to ask the question and understand the answer. That difficulty is exactly what builds fluency. You can do it.</p>
      </div>
      {{> social-share
        page="ai.html"
      }}
    </div>
  </div>
{{/layout}}

